(print "--- [DPDC-02 — supply semantics differ by kind: NFT nonce = 1, SFT nonce = quantity · 01 · namespace] ---")
(namespace "ouronet-ns")
(print "--- [DPDC-02 · 01 · per-kind supply] ---")
;;==== DPDC-02 — supply semantics differ by kind: NFT nonce = 1, SFT nonce = quantity · 02 · let / invocation ==== 
