;;The batch check is written as (= amounts (make-list (length amounts) 1)) — an equality against
;;an all-ones list — so it rejects a batch where ANY element is not 1, not merely the first.
;;==== DPDC-G5b — ...and the BATCH form enforces it element-wise · 01 · env-sigs (caps) ==== ======
