;;(`04_BRD.pact:266`). Moving past the expiry and restoring is more robust than hunting for an
;;un-upgraded entity, which would make the block depend on which suites ran. `rollback-tx` does NOT
;;undo `env-chain-data`, so the restore is mandatory.
